{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029104055906-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029113437\"/><p>現場有一輛吊臂車。(張開裕攝)</p><p>香港仔發生工業意外。今晨（29日）10時16分，石排灣道100A號香港仔漁業及海事分署，據悉，一輛吊臂車發生意外大廈撞牆，並擊傷兩名男女工人頭部，其中姓歐(62歲)男子傷勢較重，陷入半昏迷，姓盧(57歲)女工仍然清醒。二人由救護車送往瑪麗醫院救治，當局正調查意外經過及原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:01.290177+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:40:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:37.814036+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:37.814036+00:00","content_hash":"83640fe223f1aad9d74caae4a4919e3b818aa832e48b4d3958963c97accf00e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}